# Project ratchet through the host's `proj ratchet PERCENT`, not the deferred physical knob UI.
# The legitimization's ratchetProbability is 0-50 % in steps of 5, OFF (0) by default on the FM-1
# (the Mac's nil is 15 %). Stopped: the transport takes it at once. Playing: the project changes,
# the running engine keeps its own until the next Play or a template takeover. SAVE writes format 6;
# unsupported format 1 is rejected and loads documented defaults, with no legacy migration.
#   ratchet       the app project's, in %
#   eng_ratchet   the running engine's project's (stopped: the next Play's), in %; -1 nil
#   ratchets      the notes that ratchet (ratchet > 1) in the transport's patterns
# ---- a fresh boot: OFF, and the transport's project has it (0, not nil)
expect ratchet 0
expect eng_ratchet 0
proj template full 0x5EED1234
expect ratchet 0
expect eng_ratchet 0
# ---- valid project settings, stopped: the transport's at once
proj ratchet 5
expect ratchet 5
expect eng_ratchet 5
proj ratchet 20
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
# Invalid commands must leave BOTH project and transport at 20, not coerce to zero or clamp.
proj ratchet -5
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 55
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 7
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet junk
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 5x
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 5.0
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 999999999999999999999999999999
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 5 extra
expect ratchet 20
expect eng_ratchet 20
proj ratchet 50
expect ratchet 50
expect eng_ratchet 50
proj ratchet 0
expect ratchet 0
expect eng_ratchet 0
# a template keeps it (a project value of the FM-1's, not the template's)
proj ratchet 30
turn PRESET 1
expect tpl 2
expect ratchet 30
expect eng_ratchet 30
turn PRESET -1
expect tpl 1
proj template full 0x5EED1234
proj ratchet 0
expect ratchet 0
# ---- playing, OFF: 60 s (24 bars at 96, a mutation every loop of four plays): no note ratchets
tap PLAY
wait 30000
expect ratchets 0
wait 30000
expect ratchets 0
# A host command reports the deferred difference; it does not fabricate physical-knob speech.
# The project changes while playing, but the running engine keeps OFF.
proj ratchet 5
expect ratchet 5
expect stale 1
expect eng_ratchet 0
# Back to the engine's ratchet value. The setter may still mark the project stale;
# this is not a request to mutate the already running engine.
proj ratchet 0
expect ratchet 0
expect eng_ratchet 0
proj ratchet 50
expect ratchet 50
expect eng_ratchet 0
wait 60000
expect ratchets 0
# a template loaded while playing is a new engine of the project (proj_to_engine): it takes the ratchet waiting at
# its bar line, before any stop
turn PRESET 1
expect tpl 2
expect eng_ratchet 0
wait 3000
expect eng_ratchet 50
# back to the full ensemble on its seed (its bar line too), the ratchet still 50
proj template full 0x5EED1234
wait 3000
expect tpl 1
expect eng_ratchet 50
# the stop gives the transport the project; the next Play plays it (ratchets come with the mutations)
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
expect stale 0
expect eng_ratchet 50
tap PLAY
expect eng_ratchet 50
wait 60000
expect ratchets >0
# ---- SAVE (stopped), a restart: kept
tap PLAY
tap SAVE
reboot
expect ratchet 50
expect eng_ratchet 50
expect tpl 1
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
# ---- unsupported format 1: reject the record, do not import its musical settings
proj tempo 120
proj key 2 dorian
proj channel bass 5
proj format1
reboot
expect ratchet 0
expect eng_ratchet 0
expect tpl 0
expect bpm_proj 90
expect root 9
expect mode 0
expect chan2 2
expect seeded 0
# Construct a valid musical project through supported setters; SAVE uses the explicit format-6 writer.
proj template full 0x5EED1234
proj tempo 120
proj key 2 dorian
proj channel bass 5
proj ratchet 10
expect ratchet 10
expect eng_ratchet 10
tap SAVE
reboot
expect ratchet 10
expect eng_ratchet 10
expect tpl 1
expect bpm_proj 120
expect root 2
expect mode 1
expect chan2 5
expect seed_lo 0x5EED1234
expect seeded 1
expect warns 0
